---
import { restaurant } from '../data/restaurant';
---

<section id="tentang" class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white/70 border-y border-stone-200/70 backdrop-blur-xs">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left: Story Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-900">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
          <span>Cerita Warung &amp; Tradisi</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-stone-900 leading-tight">
          Dedikasi Menjaga Keaslian Resep Sunda di Walahar
        </h2>

        <!-- Featured Quote Box -->
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50/70 p-4 text-stone-800 text-sm italic leading-relaxed">
          &ldquo;Ikan jambal roti dipilih yang berdaging tebal, dibumbui rempah kuning segar khas Sunda, lalu dikukus berjam-jam dalam bungkus daun pisang alami.&rdquo;
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          {restaurant.description.map((paragraph) => (
            <p>{paragraph}</p>
          ))}
        </div>

        <!-- Cash Only Alert Box -->
        <div class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-2xs text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-bold">
            💵
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-stone-900">Informasi Pembayaran Kasir:</span>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-stone-600">Saat ini transaksi di rumah makan melayani pembayaran tunai (cash) demi kelancaran antrean.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Modern Feature Cards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <!-- Feature 1 -->
          <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-emerald-50/30 p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-emerald-700/50 hover:shadow-md">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-800 text-white text-xl shadow-sm mb-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
              🐟
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-emerald-900 transition-colors">
              Ikan Jambal Roti Pilihan
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
              Daging ikan tebal, gurih lembut, tidak amis, dan rasa asinnya sangat pas untuk santap siang.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 2 -->
          <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-amber-50/30 p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-amber-600/50 hover:shadow-md">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-amber-600 text-white text-xl shadow-sm mb-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
              🍃
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors">
              Bungkus Daun Alami
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
              Dikukus dan dibakar menggunakan daun pisang segar pilihan untuk memunculkan aroma sedap alami.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 3 -->
          <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-rose-50/30 p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-rose-600/50 hover:shadow-md">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-600 text-white text-xl shadow-sm mb-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
              🌶️
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-rose-900 transition-colors">
              Rempah Khas Sunda
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
              Racikan bumbu ulek tradisional cabai, serai, kunyit, daun salam, dan kemangi segar tanpa bahan pengawet.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 4 -->
          <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-blue-50/30 p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-600/50 hover:shadow-md">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-700 text-white text-xl shadow-sm mb-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
              🌊
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors">
              Dekat Bendungan Walahar
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
              Akses jalan mudah dari gerbang tol Klari/Karawang, cocok untuk tempat singgah istirahat dan makan bersama.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
